-- sub-form at a dimension-weakened meaning acts as σ (sub-form-dwk): the dimension part's action
-- reaches cmap-d σ N over sub-form's first two path pieces (cmap-nat-d under papp-cube-d, then
-- papp-deg-d), so by carry-uniq and carry-pcat its carry is σ's
sub-form-dwk : (Δ' Δ : CCtx) (σ : Sub Δ' Δ) (g : DNF) (Z : Type 1) (N : Mean Δ Z) →
